      "type": "text",
      "text": "I've written the complete Zephyr RTOS UART echo application to `submission/main.c`.\n\nThe application:\n- Gets the UART device from devicetree alias \"uart0\" using `DEVICE_DT_GET(DT_ALIAS(uart0))`\n- Verifies the device is ready with `device_is_ready()` before use\n- Loops forever, polling for incoming bytes with `uart_poll_in()`\n- Only echoes bytes back with `uart_poll_out()` when `uart_poll_in()` returns 0 (success)\n- Uses a tight polling loop with no delays",
